From 7d8777e69a6d5dee67ecbaf0f5ef5607e277ad5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: alan0x <theyy.me@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 20:19:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(plot): keep chart layer draw_depth inside the zbias band

Whole-unit draw_depth (0.1/2.0/3.0) made chart content win the depth
test over any chrome drawn later, so board cards painted above the
product's floating controls. Layers keep their relative order with
0.000x offsets that paint order can still outrank.
---
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/bar.rs       | 24 ++++++++++-----------
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/circular.rs  | 24 ++++++++++-----------
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/field.rs     | 18 ++++++++--------
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/hierarchy.rs | 12 +++++------
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/line.rs      |  6 +++---
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/line2.rs     | 18 ++++++++--------
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/polar.rs     | 12 +++++------
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/scatter.rs   | 18 ++++++++--------
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/stack.rs     | 18 ++++++++--------
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/stats.rs     | 12 +++++------
 crates/makepad-plot/src/charts/three_d.rs   | 18 ++++++++--------
 crates/makepad-plot/src/plot_view.rs        |  9 +++++---
 12 files changed, 96 insertions(+), 93 deletions(-)

